==Latin==
===Etymology===
Romanized form of the {{AGr.|la}} '''[[κόκκος]]''' (kokkos) "grain, seed, berry"
===Noun===
'''coccum'''  {{n}}  (plural ''cocci'')
# a [[berry]] of various plants
# a [[gaul]] of various trees
# the [[insect]], ''[[Coccus ilicis]]'', used for producing [[dye]]
# a [[scarlet]] dye, or the [[cloth]] dyed with it